        "k3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "We apologise for the temporary disruption in half of room 1 whilst the new flooring is going down.\nDon’t forget we are lucky enough to have 4 gyms under 1 roof so if any of the equipment you usually use in room 1 is temporarily out of action you will find a similar piece of equipment in some of the other rooms.\nWe hope to have all the equipment back in place shortly.\nThanks See less",
      "date": "",
      "permalink": null,
      "hasVideo": false,
      "imageKeys": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Putting some of these out in the gym.\n\n[ WE NEED HELP FROM THE COMMUNITY ]\nHey everyone,\nQuite a few people have come out to us and been discussing a business petition of sorts which is amazing - there's many, many local businesses who are screaming how bad GST will effect them and are not being listened to, and, unfortunately, we only have Social Media as evidence.\nThe Assembly have basically confirmed by their speeches and during the debate that there is a lot they don't see as meaningful, and social media was one of the big ticket points spoken about as it being an 'echo chamber' or 'not representative at all'.\nSo a physical petition feels the best option. A signed, dated petition that business owners can commit themselves to.\nHere's where we ask for help. If anyone from the community is happy to download and print the petitions and ask businesses for their signatures it'd be more helpful than you can imagine!\nLink the physical petition can be found here, it's super simple:\nhttps://docs.google.com/.../1NySPjraI.../edit...\nThanks everyone!\n- Dom See less",
      "date": "",
      "permalink": null,
      "hasVideo": false,
      "imageKeys": [
        "k4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "NO TO GST",
      "date": "",
      "permalink": null,
      "hasVideo": false,
      "imageKeys": [
        "k5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Jan’s Fitness, Mont Arrive, St Peter Port\nWe have 4 large gyms under one roof.\nEach room is fully equipped so you can mix up your workouts with choices from the various rooms.\nThe huge range of equipment means no waiting around.\nFree inductions, free workout programs.\nFREE TRIAL SESSIONS\nNo contract. No joining fee\nOpen 365 days a year.\nPlease contact us for any further information or to book a free trial session See less",
      "date": "",
      "permalink": null,
      "hasVideo": true,
      "imageKeys": [
        "k6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Jan’s Fitness, Mont Arrive, St Peter Port\nA gym that offers a huge range of equipment\nNo waiting times\nFREE inductions\nFREE workout programs\nFREE trial sessions\n#guernseygym #greatgym #gymworkouts See less",
      "date": "",
      "permalink": "https://www.facebook.com/JanFitGsy/videos/1121476966711091/",
      "hasVideo": true,
      "imageKeys": [
        "k7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Jan’s Fitness Mont Arrive\nFree trial sessions available\nCome and give us a go. As you can see the vast range of equipment means no waiting times. Contact us for any further information. See less",
      "date": "",
      "permalink": "https://www.facebook.com/JanFitGsy/videos/4115836148689815/",
      "hasVideo": true,
      "imageKeys": [
        "k8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chris had one of his knee replacements today.\nWishing him a speedy recovery.\nI’m sure he will be back in the gym within the next few days. See less",
      "date": "",
      "permalink": null,
      "hasVideo": false,
      "imageKeys": [
        "k9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "#keepquiet #nonoise #respectneighbours",
      "date": "",
      "permalink": null,
      "hasVideo": false,
      "imageKeys": [
        "k10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "PLEASE KEEP THE NOISE DOWN WHEN LEAVING THE GYM. NO RUNNING ENGINES. NO LOUD MUSIC! IFYOU NEED TO CHAT WITH YOUR MATES PLEASE DO IT IN THE GYM AND NOT IN THE CAR PARK AS VOICES CARRY, ESPECIALLY AT NIGHT TIME.\nPLEASE BE CONSCIOUS OF OUR NEIGHBOURS!\nTHANK YOU",
      "date": "",
      "permalink": null,
      "hasVideo": false,
      "imageKeys": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Jan’s Fitness, Mont Arrive, St Peter Port.\nWe recently flew a drone through the gym showing all 4 rooms & the vast range of equipment\nOpen 24/7\nNo joining or leaving fee & no contract\nFREE trial sessions available See less",
      "date": "",
