    {
      "text": "Jan’s Fitness, Mont Arrive\nStart the New Year with a 24/7 Gym that has 4 separate gyms all under one roof. Equipment for all levels. No waiting times for machines due to the extensive range of equipment in each room. No joining fee, no leaving fee, no contract. Free induction and free workout programs upon joining. Free trial sessions available. Student and senior citizen rates available. See less",
      "date": "",
      "permalink": null,
      "hasVideo": false,
      "imageKeys": [
        "k14",
        "k15",
        "k16",
        "k17",
        "k18"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "JAN’S FITNESS, MONT ARRIVE, ST PETER PORT. GY1 2AA\nOur gym is open 24/7 to members. Unlike other gyms, the vast range and multiples of our equipment means you probably won’t need to wait for anything.\nFREE TRIAL SESSIONS ARE AVAILABLE\nLet’s give you a run down of the huge range of equipment we have.\nA minimum of 15 chest stations\nA minimum of 12 different lat machines\n4 Leg curls\n4 Leg extensions\n4 leg presses\nA minimum of 10 different bicep machines\nA minimum of 12 different tricep machines\nA minimum of 8 different shoulder machines\n8 Olympic benches\n2 Deadlift platforms\n2 Squat racks\n2 sets of dumbbells\nMultiple bum machines\nMultiple Ab machines\n3 cable cross overs\n3 calf machines\nHack squat and power squats\n2 pec decks\n3 rear delt machines\n2 Hyper extension benches\nAlong with a huge range of cardio equipment\nWe also have some unusual equipment, both cardio and strength, that no other gyms have which means you won’t get bored.\nNo joining or leaving fee and NO contract\nPlease drop us a message if you would like to come and have a look around or have a free trial session See less",
      "date": "",
      "permalink": null,
      "hasVideo": false,
      "imageKeys": [
        "k19",
        "k20",
        "k21",
        "k22",
        "k23"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Jan’s Fitness, Mont Arrive\nFREE TRIAL SESSIONS AVAILABLE\nJan’s Fitness, a 24/7 Gym that has 4 separate gyms all under one roof. Equipment for all levels. No waiting times for machines due to the extensive range of equipment in each room. No joining fee, no leaving fee, no contract. Free induction and free workout programs available. Student and senior citizen rates available. See less",
      "date": "",
      "permalink": null,
      "hasVideo": false,
      "imageKeys": [
        "k24",
        "k25",
        "k26",
        "k27",
        "k28"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "We can at last bring you a 3rd Cable Crossover. This will take all attachments. There are more on order so bear with us.",
      "date": "",
      "permalink": null,
      "hasVideo": false,
      "imageKeys": [
        "k29",
        "k30",
        "k31"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "PLEASE NOTE THAT ROOM 2 WILL BE CLOSED ON SATURDAY FROM 09.00 FOR A FEW HOURS DUE TO THE CARPET BEING CLEANED.\nACCESS TO ROOM 1 WILL BE THROUGH THE MAIN FRONT DOOR WITH ACCESS TO ROOMS 3 & 4 THROUGH THE DOOR ON THE RAMP\nWE APOLOGISE FOR ANY INCONVENIENCE\nJan & Chris See less",
      "date": "",
      "permalink": null,
      "hasVideo": false,
      "imageKeys": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Jan’s Fitness Mont Arrive St Peter Port\nOur selection of cardio machines. Something different for every day See less",
      "date": "",
