      "hasVideo": false,
      "imageKeys": [
        "k32"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Jan’s Fitness Mont Arrive\nHere at Jan’s Fitness we offer what no other local gym can!\nMultiples of almost every machine. The photo collage speaks for itself with more to be added. Over 150 machines, plus free weights and bars. This means there will be no waiting times for your workout. We have a huge range of cardio equipment including some unusual machines. The gym is split over 4 large rooms, with each room being a stand alone gym.\nWe are open 24/7 to members. There is no joining or leaving fee and no contract. We offer free trial sessions so you can see and try out the vast amount of equipment.\nIf you are interested in coming in to view or for a free trial session please let us know. See less",
      "date": "",
