    {
      "text": "Jan’s Fitness Mont Arrive\nWhere can you find 4 separate gyms for the price of 1 - all under one roof? NO contract, NO joining fee, NO leaving fee.\nHere at Jan’s we can offer the most extensive range of equipment than any other gym locally.\nWe offer multiples of most equipment which means there is no waiting time.\n20 chest stations. 4 leg presses. 4 leg extensions. 4 leg curls. 3 calf machines. 9 Olympic benches. 12 lat machines. 10 bicep stations. 12 tricep stations, 9 shoulder machines, 6 ab machines. 2 platforms. 2 squat racks as well as a huge range of cardio equipment & lots more. £68 a month.\nFREE workout programs. FREE inductions.\nStudent rates (16/over)available.\nFor a FREE trial session please drop us a message. See less",
